  <data name="textBox1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Cycle - To the left of the :: the cycle days per operation, to the right of the :: adjustment days if any.

Op Est Done - Operation estimated completion date based on the start date of the operation plus the cycle days plus delay/extend adjustment days.

Op Plan Due - Operation planned completion date based on the Sales Order delivery date then calculated back including job and part subsequent days and cycle days.

Calc Proj Dlvr - Calculated projected delivery date based on the estimated completion date of the last operation based on production history including job and part subsequent days. This value is recalculated every time a production step varies from the schedule.

SO Plan Dlvr - Sales Order delivery date from MK adjusted earlier if the delivery date is on a weekend.

Delta - Sales Order delivery date minus calculated projected delivery date.

SO Reqd - Required date from the Sales Order.



</value>
  </data>
  <data name="textBox2.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Op Est Done - Red when date is less than today.

Op Plan Due - Red when date is less than today.

Calc Proj Dlvr - Red when greater than Sales Oorder planned delivery date.

SO Plan Dlvr - Rec when Sales Order delivery date greater than the Sales Order required date.

Delta - Red when negative.</value>
